  "result": "Both seat-accounting bugs are fixed in three files. I haven't run the test suite.\n\n- **Removing a member** (`src/server/services/usage-service.ts`): the write-path listeners now subtract a seat on `member.removed`, as they already add one on `member.joined`.\n- **Periodic recount** (`src/server/repositories/usage-repository.ts`): `recomputeUsage` counts only members that are `active` and not archived, so the rollup matches the live count.\n- **Pending invitations** (`src/server/repositories/invitation-repository.ts`): `countPendingInvitations` now excludes revoked invitations as well as accepted ones.\n\nRe-sending works through the same count. `resendInvitation` revokes the old invitation before calling `inviteMember`, so the fixed count frees its seat before the fullness check runs.",
